<view class="page">
  <back-navbar style="height: {{navBarHeight}}rpx;" title="升级加盟" show-back="{{true}}" avatar="/images/back-gray.png" bindnavbuttontap="toBack"></back-navbar>
  <view class="content">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="eyebrow">当前经营组织</view>
      <view class="title">将“{{organizationName}}”升级为加盟总部</view>
      <view class="scope-tip">本次升级针对整个经营组织，不是当前正在查看的某一家门店。</view>

      <view class="store-scope">
        <view class="scope-header">
          <text class="scope-title">纳入加盟总部的现有门店</text>
          <text class="scope-count">{{storeCount}} 家</text>
        </view>
        <view class="store-list" wx:if="{{storeNames.length}}">
          <text class="store-tag" wx:for="{{storeNames}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="empty-store" wx:else>暂无可展示的门店名称，升级时将按经营组织校验。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="desc">升级后会建立加盟公司、品牌和总部管理关系。现有门店及其采购、库存、菜品和历史数据全部保留，不会重复创建经营数据。</view>
      <button class="primary" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="createCode">生成组织加盟升级码</button>
    </view>

    <view class="card code-card" wx:if="{{upgradeCode}}">
      <view class="label">加盟升级码</view>
      <view class="code" bindtap="copyCode">{{upgradeCode}}</view>
      <view class="expiry">有效至 {{expiresAt}}，点击升级码可复制</view>
      <view class="steps">请打开“精彩账本加盟总部”管理小程序，在首页选择“已有餐馆升级”，填写公司和品牌资料并输入此码。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  </view>
</view>
